### Fullstack

- Deliver features end to end: data model, API, client state, interface, and tests.
- Treat the API contract as the single source of truth shared by both layers.
- Keep validation rules consistent across the boundary, with the server as the final authority.
- Reuse generated or shared types instead of redefining payloads per layer.
- Keep transport, business logic, and presentation concerns in separate modules.
- Verify the whole flow after changes to either layer, not only the layer you edited.
